Package: cinminai-shell
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Cin-MinAI <https://github.com/Cin-MinAI/Cin-MinAI>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-pyte, bash
Description: Cin-MinAI terminal sharing
 Lets the Cin-MinAI assistant see the terminals you choose to share: each
 command, its output and whether it worked, so it can help when something
 fails. Off until you turn it on; shared terminals show a diamond in the
 prompt, and "ai off" makes one private. Nothing is captured at password
 prompts, and nothing leaves the computer.
